cer and Non Teaching Post Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SGPGI Nursing Officer and Non Teaching Post 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1479 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Nursing Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1200</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Accounts Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Nuclear Medicine Technologist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Administrative Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">32</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">64</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=