70.7367%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Nursing Officer&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc. (Hons.) Nursing / B.Sc. Nursing Degree&nbsp;<strong>OR&nbsp;</strong>Diploma in General Nursing Midwifery (GNM), 02 Years Exp. in a Min. 50 bedded Hospital, Registered as Nurses &amp; Midwife in State / Indian Nursing Council,</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Administrative Assistant&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate with knowledge of Noting &amp; Drafting and Knowledge of Computer, Typing (English : 30 wpm&nbsp; <strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">OR</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;Hindi : 25 wpm), 01 Year Experience.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Any Bachelor’s Degree, Shorthand Speed : 80 wpm, Knowledge of Computer.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CSSD Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12th Passed in Science with Diploma in CSSD.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Draftsman</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10th Passed, 02 Years ITI in Civil Draughtsmanship.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Hospital Attendant Gr-II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10th Class Passed.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Account Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.Com (55% Marks) with Accountancy with 02 Years Experience of Accounts &amp; Knowledge of Computer.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (CWS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.E / B.Tech Degree in Electronics / Glass Technology / Mechanical Engineering.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Nuclear Medicine Technologist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc. in Life science and Other Science, 01 Year Diploma in Medical Radiation and Isotope Techniques (DMRIT) OR equivalent approved by AERB.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Store Keeper</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PG Degree / Diploma in Material Management of a recognized University/ Institution, Knowledge of Computers.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Social Service Officer Gr-II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Master’s Degree in Social Work, Experience in the line with a Welfare of Health Agency.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2633%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OT Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.7367%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc. (Anesthesia / Operation Theatre Technologist).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply SGPGI Nursing Officer and Non Teaching Post Exam City Details 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Exam City Details link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the exam city details &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the exam city details also from the official website of SGPGI.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SGPGI Nursing Officer and Non Teaching Post Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Skill Test (If Applicable)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<